  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### Tax Summary\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 30 Jun, 2026 at  6:10 PM\n\n### Overview\n\nThe Tax Summary section provides an overview of the taxpayer's tax position for a selected tax year. It displays key tax figures, including taxable income, tax charged, and payment amounts due.\n\n### Navigation\n\nSelf Assessment > SA100 > Client Specific > Tax Summary\n\n### Review the Tax Summary\n\nThe Tax Summary displays the following information for the selected year:\n\n - Total Taxable Income\n\n - Total Tax Charged\n\n - Total Payment Due by 31 January\n\n - Total Payment Due by 31 July\n\nNote: The payment due dates displayed will correspond to the selected tax year.\n\n### Additional Help\n\n### Need Help?\n\nIf you need assistance or guidance, please contact your onboarding manager or email Support@capium.com, or call us on 020 3322 5578.\n\n### Related Articles\n\nCreate a New SA100\n\nView SA100 HMRC Form\n\nSelf Assessment Supplementary Pages\n\n### \n\n### \n\n### \n\n### \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188542\">Self Assessment Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Tax Summary\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 30 Jun, 2026 at  6:10 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Tax Summary</strong> section provides an overview of the taxpayer's tax position for a selected tax year. It displays key tax figures, including taxable income, tax charged, and payment amounts due.</p><hr><h2><strong>Navigation</strong></h2><p><strong>Self Assessment &gt; SA100 &gt; Client Specific &gt; Tax Summary</strong></p><p><em dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250778398/original/N5konGnosxdaPpT1IoBebs5jejcrIsopiw.png?1782839308\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9250778398\"></em></p><hr><h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Review the Tax Summary</strong></h3><p>The Tax Summary displays the following information for the selected year:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Total Taxable Income</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Total Tax Charged</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Total Payment Due by 31 January</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Total Payment Due by 31 July</strong><strong dir=\"ltr\"><br></strong><strong dir=\"ltr\"><br></strong><strong dir=\"ltr\"><em>Note:</em></strong><em>&nbsp;The payment due dates displayed will correspond to the selected tax year.<br></em></p></li></ul><hr><h2><strong>Additional Help</strong></h2><h3>Need Help?</h3><p>If you need assistance or guidance, please contact your onboarding manager or email <strong><a href=\"mailto:Support@capium.com\">Support@capium.com</a></strong>, or call us on <strong>020 3322 5578</strong>.</p><hr><h2><strong dir=\"ltr\">Related Articles</strong></h2><ul><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000165518?portalId=9000044273\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 63, 210);\">Create a New SA100</a></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000165520?portalId=9000044273\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 63, 210);\">View SA100 HMRC Form</a></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solut